### CampusQuest Subjects Tests

### 1. Get All Subjects
GET http://localhost:5000/subjects

### 2. Get Subjects filtered by Semester
GET http://localhost:5000/subjects?semester=5

### 3. Get Subject by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/subjects/1

### 4. Create Subject (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:5000/subjects
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Cloud Computing",
    "description": "Virtualization, AWS, Microservices, and Serverless architectures.",
    "semester": 6
}

### 5. Update Subject (Admin Only)
PUT http://localhost:5000/subjects/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Database Management Systems (RDBMS)",
    "description": "Advanced Relational Data Models, Indexing, and Transactions.",
    "semester": 5
}
